From 48ef107dbd9b7d729c79f2d5c32ea6a329874fde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IMD Ember <operator@imdember.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:19:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] GOLD panel and wallet HUD: stop false "ledger
 unavailable", show error codes, unlock stuck prompts

- auth.ts keeps the session object when a routine re-read finds the same address and expiry. Readers compare
  sessions by identity, so a fresh copy on every focus/other-tab/timer read made in-flight GOLD and balance reads
  fail as CONTEXT_CHANGED: the GOLD panel fell into "ledger unavailable" and the wallet HUD flickered.
- GOLD panel: a failed refresh keeps the last good ledger and names the code; refresh shows "reading"; the
  no-data message carries the code; a failed payment-settings read is reported and retried by Refresh;
  ordering/signing errors scroll into view.
- Wallet HUD: a failed refresh keeps the last balances (only the note changes); CONTEXT_CHANGED is not a failure.
- GOLD signature prompt gives up after 3 minutes (WALLET_TIMEOUT) instead of locking the panel.
- Day-pass card says when GOLD is short and does not create an unpayable order.
- Wording for INVALID_GOLD_CHALLENGE (device clock), CHALLENGE_EXPIRED, INSUFFICIENT_GOLD, ECONOMY_HALTED,
  NOT_CONFIGURED, INVALID_CHAIN_RESPONSE, WALLET_TIMEOUT, RATE_LIMITED, INVALID_SIGNATURE.
- AIMarket pane: no trial/pass polling while the tab is hidden; trial poll 5 s -> 15 s; read on becoming visible.

Found in the owner's first real top-up and the independent review of 2026-10-26.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
